  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's motion and perception capabilities, separating motion commands from sensor events. The specification encodes a safe, coverage-oriented supervisor: it prefers random_walk in clear states, uses short forward moves for progress, and applies directed turns for obstacle recovery. Recovery from front obstacles uses rotate_clockwise; left/right obstacles use rotate_clockwise/counterclockwise respectively. Full_rotate is reserved for rare, persistent blockages. The design ensures safety, steady exploration, and avoids oscillations or excessive rotation.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for motion and perception to reflect hardware modularity.",
